  "description": "Calix Bastian, the empire’s one and only Grand Duke, harbors a secret obsession for Evan Chris, a low-ranking knight renowned for his beauty. One night, under the cover of a training drill, Calix sneaks into Evan’s room and is caught in the middle of a private act he cannot take back. Using that moment as leverage, the two begin meeting in secret, their bodies drawn together by desire. But for Calix, lust alone soon feels hollow. He wants something more, but how do you ask for love when all you've ever known is touch?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
